WEBVTT

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.320
Seira!

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.790
Reika!

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:25.210
Britney!

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.600
Tina!

00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.590
Celebrity 4!

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.850
Long time no see, Hibiki-sama!

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:50.210
With the end of the Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix approaching.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:55.390
We've heard that you still haven't decided on a fifth member for your team.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:01:01.950
How about you choose from one of our members, blessed with beauty and talent?

00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:04.940
This is why we've come.

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:08.890
You say you're competing in the Stupid Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix?

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.010
You let me down in summer...

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.070
B-But

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:15.090
everyone has their off-days!

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.650
I didn't sleep too well!

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:17.840
I care not for excuses.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:21.820
Also, I'm planning to have Leona West as my fifth member.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.810
There's no room for any of you!

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:25.270
Eh!?

00:01:26.990 --> 00:01:28.720
How dare she pick Leona West?

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:29.690
Who's Leona anyway?

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.890
We'll prove that we're up to the task this time!

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:34.770
Of course!

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:39.230
Sorry for the wait,

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:40.890
here you go!

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:42.780
What's that?

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:45.970
A new song for Leona-san.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.430
It's in the Pact.

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:53.130
I'm looking forward to seeing you perform!

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.840
I wonder what the new songs like!

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:57.660
It's a song for us!

00:01:57.790 --> 00:01:59.710
For us...?

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.800
You mean us two?

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:01.640
Yeah!

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.090
I've already entered us for a concert.

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:05.250
Yeah!

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:08.000
I'm so pumped up for the Spring Dream Gran Prix!

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:10.200
You know, Dorothy...

00:02:10.910 --> 00:02:11.880
The truth is...

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.840
About that...

00:02:14.490 --> 00:02:15.410
The truth is...

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:20.410
Hibiki-san invited me onto her team.

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:22.910
Eh!?

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.800
And I want to give it a try.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:34.050
Wh-W-W-W-W-What...

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:09.060
The Revenge Of
Celebrity 4

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.950
This new song

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:14.970
is the next step for us, Dorothy.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.730
Why!? Why!?

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.400
What happened Leona!?

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.060
Do you understand what you're saying!?

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.110
Because I sure don't!

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:25.420
If I'm on Hibiki-san's side...

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:30.300
If Hibiki-san won the Spring Dream Gran Prix,

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:35.040
then I might be able to stop her from ringing the bell at the next Dream Concert.

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.750
Huh!? Shikyouin will win!?

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.300
No way, obviously we're the ones who are gonna win!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.300
Dorothy...

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:46.620
No! No-No! No-No-No!

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:49.530
I don't want to do a farewell concert!

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:52.180
Why Leona!?

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:53.800
Dorothy, listen to me!

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.010
You're being tricked by her Leona!

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.050
I'm totally against it!

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:59.510
Dorothy...

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:01.430
Leona, you idiot!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:02.660
Dorothy!

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.600
Stupid, stupid, stupid Leona!

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:09.780
He's being tricked by her, I'm gonna give her a piece of my mind!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.240
Take this!

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:15.990
What's this!?

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.600
We got Leona West!

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:19.720
When we combine our strength we can do anything!
We got Leona West!

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.580
I've seen you guys before!

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:22.650
What are you up to!?

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:24.340
She sure is a loud one.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:36.820
It's pointless to squirm!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:40.860
You're 100 light-years too early for Hibiki-sama's team!

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:49.230
You yellowtail teriyaki!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.310
Yellowtail teriyaki!

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:53.790
Made with mirin all glazed...

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.110
We're actually Celebrity 4!

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:57.350
Don't forget that!

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.370
How rude!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.980
What are you on about!?

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:01.560
What are you going to do?

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.580
Hurry up and set me free already!

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:06.060
Sorry, but we'll be keeping you here for a while.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.860
Until the Spring Dream Gran Prix is over!

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.970
Huh!? Where are we?

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.680
Does a place like this exist in PriPara?

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.000
This is the basement of CelePara castle.

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:14.870
Basement?

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.230
This is what a basement looks like, Leona West.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.350
There's even a dungeon!

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:22.750
I'm actually Dorothy West!

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:23.520
What!?

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.960
What! What's going on!?

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:28.640
She's right, I knew something was off!

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:31.560
It says that Leona is gentle and feminine!

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.300
This one is unrefined

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.390
and violent!

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:34.940
Huh?

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:38.770
So we got Leona's stupid sister Dorothy?

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:39.580
Hey!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:42.820
You say you're competing in the Stupid Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix?

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.090
What a mistake...

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:49.050
Hey, I don't want to be insulted by a bunch of old, washed-up, has-been hags!

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.070
How rude!

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:53.260
We're in high school!

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.420
So they were going after Leona...

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:59.650
It's a good thing they mistook me for him!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:03.720
Where did Dorothy go?

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.600
Dorothy?

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:10.280
Yellowtail teriyaki 4?

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.120
It's Celebrity 4!

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.860
You remember me, right!?

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:16.100
We have Dorothy.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:16.700
Eh!?

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.040
As if we'd let her compete in the Spring Dream Gran Prix!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:24.770
Ah!

00:07:25.270 --> 00:07:27.000
If you want her back safely,

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.480
come to the third floor of the castle basement, alone.

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.500
Leona, don't come!

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.960
I can get out of this myself!

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.650
What are you doing!?

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:37.410
Dorothy!

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.460
What did you do to her?

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:44.540
Don't try any funny stuff, I'll come right away.

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:48.680
Stay where you are.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.190
How cute.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:54.660
She sounds so funny trying to be intimidating.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.680
You got it?

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:59.080
Don't worry about your sister,
we'll give her plenty of love!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.680
You hungry?

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:09.290
Do you know what Okonomiyaki is?

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:13.690
Meat, vegetables, all combined in your own way!

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:17.820
All poured on a skillet and grilled.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:21.820
Then it gets bigger, before flipping it, and

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.740
it's almost done!

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:27.340
Do you prefer sauce or mayo? We have both!

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:29.400
Sounds delicious!

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.840
If you untie me, I'll make you some.

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:32.810
Really?

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:35.550
Hurry! Hurry up!

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:37.030
Now!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.670
Where do you think you're going?

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.250
How mean, you tricked me!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.500
There's a cell outside the cell too!?

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:51.770
Tina, what were you thinking letting her trick you like that!?

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:53.370
But...

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:54.810
You're no good.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.520
The traps are perfect!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:04.230
Come anytime, Leona.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:06.650
What are they thinking?

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:08.870
Don't come, Leona!

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:16.620
Newborn lamb!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:19.080
We'll escort you!

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:25.360
Michael, Johnny, stop it!

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.930
Don't mess around!

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:33.550
Dorothy!

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:43.070
Hold on Dorothy, I'll be there shortly.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:08.230
Phew, a failed trap.

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.770
A lazer trap?

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:13.590
I've gotta make it through without breaking any

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:23.580
Phew, cleared it safely.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.600
Isn't this just red string?

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:32.480
She's here!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.230
Leona!?

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.980
I told you not to come!

00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.430
These guys are insane!

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:40.620
How dare you take Dorothy, release her at once!

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:46.160
You really think we'd just give her back like that?

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:47.710
I'll give you this instead!

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:53.250
Mission accomplished, too easy.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.390
Only clothes?

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.420
I've been had!

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:59.250
A Ninja?

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.630
Ninja Technique: Body Change.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:03.440
It worked!

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:05.170
Take this!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.560
Time!

00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:14.020
Leona, what are you doing!?

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:16.050
I told you to make snowballs!

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:18.660
Making snow rabbits? Are you a girl?

00:11:18.760 --> 00:11:21.560
His eyes are all red, he looks like a snow rabbit!

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:26.270
If you like snowballs so much,

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.010
how's about you kiss one!

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:28.700
Dorothy!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.800
Serves you right!

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:33.280
Thank you Dorothy

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:37.440
I'll protect you Leona, so don't stray too far!

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:44.890
Ninja Technique: The Silent Stride.

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:50.940
Caught myself

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.330
Let me go!

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:52.470
Caught myself

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:55.720
a rodent!

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:57.900
Ninja Technique: Flour!

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.280
I'm free! Now's just for this one!

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.550
Stop right there!

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:13.150
Where did she go?

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:16.670
I won't let you escape!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.410
Ninja Technique: Hidden Body.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:22.760
Found you!

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:25.470
I'm a high school girl!

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:32.210
Now!

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:40.400
We won't let you go that easily!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:41.860
Leona!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:47.040
Looks like we're one step ahead!

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:00.750
Thank you, mice!

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:03.960
What's up with this door!?

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:05.560
I won't budge an inch!

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:06.630
Dorothy!

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:08.630
Leona! Are you okay?

00:13:08.630 --> 00:13:12.600
Hold on! I'll file the lock!

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.940
I told you not to come, stupid Leona!

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.720
So why did you come!?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:25.340
It's stuck!

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.780
Leona's the ballboy, isn't he?

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.040
Leona should go, obviously

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.550
Yeah!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:35.490
If everyone says so...

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:41.670
It broke!

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.580
I-I got it.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:49.120
Thanks, okay let's carry on!

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:53.830
W-Wait...

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:07.900
Dorothy!

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:10.290
Okay let's get you down.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:12.710
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.160
You're hungry right?

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:14.800
Yeah.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:16.860
We're having Okonomiyaki today!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:17.950
What's that?

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:19.890
Food from overseas.

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:26.430
Dorothy always came to my rescue.

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:29.120
Now it's my turn.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:30.980
Leona...

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.630
Leona has grown.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:45.400
I hadn't realized...

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:48.450
It broke!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:49.350
Not so fast!

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.050
Dorothy! Leona West!

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:54.830
We'll stop you!

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.290
Let's go, Dorothy!

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.950
Gorgeous!

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:02.430
Full-speed dash!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.720
We came out here again!?

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:23.730
Fireworks!

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:24.950
They look delicious-nano!

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:31.870
Thanks, Leona.

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:38.310
I know...

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:42.380
I want to sing with you!

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:43.230
Really?

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.930
I'll let you join the team.

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:51.080
You can stand on your own two feet now.

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.330
I'll let you join.

00:15:57.270 --> 00:16:00.840
Dorothy, although we may be apart,

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.760
it's only for the Spring Dream Gran Prix.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:04.940
Let's go.

00:16:06.970 --> 00:16:08.600
If you say so, Leona.

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.310
Let's go!

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:15.420
Scan the MyTickets required for your cord.

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:19.790
You can can you Friend Tickets too.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.050
Cord Change Start!

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:26.540
The new fortune party cord

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:29.270
has a parker with a short, sporty style.

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:32.290
Skater twins dorothy cord!

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.460
To bring back memories of your childhood overseas,

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:39.730
inline skates are featured.

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:42.780
Skater Twins Leona Cord!

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:16.190
Making Drama, switch on!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:21.220
Full-power dash!

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:33.150
Tension max!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.880
Tension relax!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:39.080
Soar, balloon! Fortune...

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.140
Max!

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:41.850
Relax!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:46.540
Airy Change!

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.230
Gold Airy!

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:02.170
Tension max!

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:04.120
Relax!

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.630
Dorothy, Leona, congratulations!

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:15.670
Pop

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:15.780
Very
Popular
Idol

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:19.130
You've ranked up to Very Popular Idols!

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:19.420
Very
Popular
Idol

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:27.640
I'm joining Hibiki-san's team!

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:41.610
It's me this time!?

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:50.050
Congratulations!

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:54.780
The members of the two teams going head to head in
the Spring Dream Gran Prix have been confirmed!

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:58.590
The members of the Dream Team and Friend All.

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:02.570
One of us will become the Princess of the Seasons!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.280
If that happens, PriPara will gain a few levels.

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:08.840
You can't become a Vocal Doll-pri!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:13.260
We'll compete to become the Princess of the Seasons, with the same goal in mind!

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.780
It's looking like another personal war, fine by me.

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:17.400
Curly-chan?

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:19.310
W-We've got to win!

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:23.740
All the competitors are aiming to become the Princess of the Seasons!

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.290
A 10-way battle!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:29.870
To win, their songs must pave the way for a new world!

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:32.820
Please pave the way

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:38.070
and find a new world!
